                    5339, Box 3, HS Official, Chronological. Confidential; Exdis. Drafted by Maresca
                    and approved by Hartman. The meeting took place in Finlandia Hall.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d333-f2" n="2" xml:id="d333-f2-content">
                <p>For the President’s speech before the CSCE on August 1, see Department of State
                    Bulletin, September 1, 1975, pp. 304–308.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
